---
layout: base.njk
title: Blog
description: How Bubble Shooter 3D is made, from the people making it - the problems we ran into and what we did about them, written for the curious.
permalink: /blog/
---
{% include "bar.njk" %}
  <main class="wrap blog">
    <h1>Blog</h1>
    <p class="lead">What we ran into while making a bubble shooter in three dimensions, and what we did about it: the lattice, the Raspberry Pi, the music, the colour. Written from the project's own record, with the figures we measured.</p>
    <ol class="postlist">
{%- for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
      <li class="postcard">
        <p class="post-meta"><time datetime="{{ post.date.toISOString() }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
{%- for topic in post.data.topics %}<span class="topic">{{ topic }}</span>{% endfor %}</p>
        <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
        <p>{{ post.data.summary }}</p>
      </li>
{%- endfor %}
    </ol>
    <p class="post-back">Follow along with the <a href="/feed.xml">Atom feed</a>, or read the <a href="{{ site.repo }}">source</a> every post is written from.</p>
  </main>
